1   VP is ADJP
# A.2 sentence 9: auxiliary "is" + -ing verb + object. VING is separate from V1, so "*Sally is ate" is impossible.
1   VP is VING NP
1   VING eating
# A.2 sentence 10: copula "is" + noun phrase.
1   VP is NP

4	NP	Det Noun 
